-prince-ying:p008:m0267","surface":"穎","start":267,"end":268,"person_id":"x4m_ygm_1d3","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-ying:p008:m0276","surface":"徽","start":276,"end":277,"person_id":"fb9_e1a_dc1","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-ying:p008:m0284","surface":"穎","start":284,"end":285,"person_id":"x4m_ygm_1d3","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-ying:p008:m0294","surface":"徽","start":294,"end":295,"person_id":"fb9_e1a_dc1","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-ying:p008:m0302","surface":"穎","start":302,"end":303,"person_id":"x4m_ygm_1d3","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-ying:p008:m0351","surface":"穎","start":351,"end":352,"person_id":"x4m_ygm_1d3","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-ying:p008:m0365","surface":"徽","start":365,"end":366,"person_id":"fb9_e1a_dc1","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-ying","book_id":"b-jinshu-059","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-059-prince-ying-ws2650517"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line013","text":"趙王倫篡位，敦叔父彥為兗州刺史，倫遣敦慰勞之。會諸王起義兵；彥被齊王冏檄，懼倫兵強，不敢應命，敦勸彥起兵應諸王，故彥遂立勳績。惠帝反正，敦遷散騎常侍、左衛將軍、大鴻臚、侍中，出除廣武將軍、青州刺史。永嘉初，徵為中書監。于時天下大亂，敦悉以公主時侍婢百餘人配給將士，金銀寶物散之於眾，單車還洛。東海王越自滎陽來朝，敦謂所親曰：「今威權悉在太傅，而選用表情，尚書猶以舊制裁之，太傅今至，必有誅罰。」俄而越收中書令繆播等十餘人殺之。越以敦為揚州刺史，潘滔說越曰：「今樹處仲于江外，使其肆豪強之心，是見賊也。」越不從。其後徵拜尚書，不就。元帝召為安東軍諮祭酒。會揚州刺史劉陶卒，帝復以敦為揚州刺史，加廣武將軍。尋進左將軍、都督征討諸軍事、假節。帝初鎮江東，威名未著，敦與從弟導等同心翼戴，以隆中興，時人為之語曰：「王與馬，共天下。」尋與甘卓等討江州刺史華軼，斬之。","annotation_status":"reviewed","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line013:m0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"趙王倫","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAG","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line013:m0006","start":6,"end":7,"surface":"