，出除廣武將軍、青州刺史。永嘉初，徵為中書監。于時天下大亂，敦悉以公主時侍婢百餘人配給將士，金銀寶物散之於眾，單車還洛。東海王越自滎陽來朝，敦謂所親曰：「今威權悉在太傅，而選用表情，尚書猶以舊制裁之，太傅今至，必有誅罰。」俄而越收中書令繆播等十餘人殺之。越以敦為揚州刺史，潘滔說越曰：「今樹處仲于江外，使其肆豪強之心，是見賊也。」越不從。其後徵拜尚書，不就。元帝召為安東軍諮祭酒。會揚州刺史劉陶卒，帝復以敦為揚州刺史，加廣武將軍。尋進左將軍、都督征討諸軍事、假節。帝初鎮江東，威名未著，敦與從弟導等同心翼戴，以隆中興，時人為之語曰：「王與馬，共天下。」尋與甘卓等討江州刺史華軼，斬之。","raw_start":523,"raw_end":901,"raw_line":13},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji","book_id":"b-jinshu-098","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-044","source_id":"s-jinshu-044-luzhi","source":{"title":"晉書卷四十四","provider":"Wikisource","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1775345","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1775345","revision_id":1775345,"accessed_on":"2026-11-21","extent":"固定數位題「珽子志」題下全文。","text_scope":"partial_chapter","review_status":"text_checked","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代本文及維基文庫數位轉錄。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","edition":"維基文庫固定修訂1775345","raw_path":"sources/jinshu/wikisource-1775345-raw.wikitext","wikitext_sha256":"09742e651b479fea881fd24c7734451de2b78b9f0410adda36ba210c31a0b5c8","raw_file_sha256":"09742e651b479fea881fd24c7734451de2b78b9f0410adda36ba210c31a0b5c8","collation_witnesses":["source-evidence/jin044-luzhi/reading.json"]}},{"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-ying","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-059","source_id":"s-jinshu-059-prince-ying-ws2650517","source":{"title":"晉書卷五十九·司馬穎","provider":"Wikisource","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2650517","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2650517","revision_id":2650517,"edition":"維基文庫固定修訂","accessed_on":"2026-11-22","review_status":"text_checked","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫授權。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","extent":"晉書卷五十九·司馬穎","text_scope":"complete_biography_unit","raw_path":"source-evidence/jin059-roll/ws2650517.wiki